# ⚙️ Installation

## Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Mithrun055/ai-task-assistant.git
```

```
cd ai-task-assistant
```

---

# Backend Setup

Navigate to backend

```bash
cd backend
```

Create virtual environment

```bash
python -m venv venv
```

Activate

### Windows

```bash
venv\Scripts\activate
```

Install packages

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Create a `.env` file

```
GROQ_API_KEY=your_api_key
```

Run Backend

```bash
python -m uvicorn main:app --reload
```

Backend runs on

```
http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

---

# Frontend Setup

Open another terminal

```
cd frontend
```

Install dependencies

```
npm install
```

Run frontend

```
npm run dev
```

Frontend runs on

```
http://localhost:5173
```

---

# API Flow

```
User
   │
   ▼
React Frontend
   │
Axios Request
   │
   ▼
FastAPI Backend
   │
CrewAI Agent
   │
Groq LLM
   │
   ▼
AI Response
   │
   ▼
Frontend
```

